    "title": "List conversion goals",
    "category": "Marketing analytics",
    "description": "List the configured marketing conversion goals for the current project. Each goal returns its conversion_goal_id — the value the explain, update and delete tools take — plus its kind (EventsNode / ActionsNode / DataWarehouseNode), target, last-30d count, and the integrated vs non-integrated split. Non-integrated breaks into two buckets with OPPOSITE fixes: events_without_utm_source (tag UTMs) vs events_with_unmatched_utm_source (add a custom source mapping). is_approximate is true when the 30d count may differ from the dashboard's attribution-windowed number.",
